This crate is a derivative work: a from-scratch Rust translation of the
archived, patched Box2D.min.js (Box2DFlash 2.1a / box2dweb) that the
Hitbox.io client runs. The patches (SafeTrig rounding, novakReset) are
reproduced; see API.md for the omitted and preserved quirks.
